print frame "436f6e74656e742d4c656e6774683a20310d0a0d0a7b" is rejected with status the json rpc invalid json status while hanging false as a line
print frame "436f6e74656e742d4c656e6774683a20320d0a0d0a5b5d" is rejected with status the json rpc invalid message status while hanging false as a line
