set command to the strict transport test command for "436f6e74656e742d4c656e6774683a2033300d0a436f6e74656e742d547970653a204170706c69636174696f6e2f5673636f64652d4a736f6e727063203b2043686172736574203d20225554462d38220d0a0d0a7b226a736f6e727063223a22322e30222c226d6574686f64223a226d227d" hanging false with ""
set opened to the result of opening a json rpc connection using command under the strict transport test limits
set connection to opened's connection
set message to the next json rpc message from connection
print message's succeeded as a line
free json rpc receive result message
set ending to the next json rpc message from connection
print ((ending's status = the json rpc end of stream status) and (connection's state = the json rpc peer closed state)) as a line
set repeated to the next json rpc message from connection
print (repeated's status = the json rpc end of stream status) as a line
free json rpc receive result ending
free json rpc receive result repeated
set closure to the result of closing json rpc connection connection
print closure's succeeded as a line
free json rpc connection connection
